<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's credit firm ACRED profits rise.</title>
<headline>Morocco's credit firm ACRED profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's credit firm ACRED said on Wednesday its profits rose to 17 million dirhams ($1.84 million) in 1996 from 14.2 million dirhams the year before.</p>
<p>Turnover for 1996 was 91.7 million dirhams from 72 million dirhams in 1995.</p>
<p>Listed on the Casablanca stock exchange, it closed at 460 dirhams on March 24 when it last traded.</p>
<p>($ = 9.2 dirhams)</p>
</text>
